          LE.le.{0} v (FiniteEditAlgorithm.cutoff m) ∧
            Eq.{1} (FiniteEditAlgorithm.residual s m v)
              (FiniteEditAlgorithm.best s m (HSub.hSub.{0, 0, 0} (FiniteEditAlgorithm.cutoff m) 1))
'ResearchCommons.Claims.FiniteEditOptimum.global_optimum' depends on axioms: [propext,
